{"suttaId":"thag4.6","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1397,1409],"vripara":"287"},"segments":{"thag4.6:0.4":"Senakattheragāthā","thag4.6:1.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi, gayāyaṃ gayaphagguyā;","thag4.6:1.3":"Yaṃ addasāsiṃ sambuddhaṃ, desentaṃ dhammamuttamaṃ.","thag4.6:2.1":"“Mahappabhaṃ gaṇācariyaṃ, aggapattaṃ vināyakaṃ;","thag4.6:2.3":"Sadevakassa lokassa, jinaṃ atuladassanaṃ.","thag4.6:3.1":"“Mahānāgaṃ mahāvīraṃ, mahājutimanāsavaṃ;","thag4.6:3.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇaṃ, satthāramakutobhayaṃ.","thag4.6:4.1":"“Cirasaṃkiliṭṭhaṃ vata maṃ, diṭṭhisandānabandhitaṃ [sandhitaṃ (sī. syā.), sanditaṃ (pī. sī. aṭṭha.)];","thag4.6:4.3":"Vimocayi so bhagavā, sabbaganthehi senakan”ti.","thag4.6:4.5":"… Senako thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
